<div class="wrap page-head"><span class="eyebrow">The company</span><h1>About us</h1></div>
<section class="band white"><div class="wrap split">
  <div class="stack">
    <p>CHR Costruzioni is a building company in Bologna run by Ion Chirila. The company is young, but the people in it have been doing this job for over 12 years.</p>
    <p>We follow every job in person, from the site visit to handover. We prefer to tell you straight away what can be done and what it costs, with no surprises halfway through.</p>
    <p>Ion is always on site, together with his brother, who works with him in the company.</p>
    <p>We work in Bologna and throughout its province. Ion speaks English, so we can look after international clients from the site visit to handover.</p>
  </div>
